# The doorway: a room split by a wall with a doorway 2 m wide, and twenty agents on one side that walk through it to
# the places across the door from where they started, wait for each other there, and walk back (see
# docs/ai/navigation.md#crowds). The crowd finds their paths on the navmesh that the Navigation volume bakes, keeps
# them apart, and moves their characters; crosser.luau only sends them. Select one in the editor while the game plays
# to see its corridor, its corners, its neighbors and its velocities. Positions are raw World_Position values in units
# of 2^-24 m, so 2516582400000000000 is 1.5e11 m. The editor writes this file; see
# docs/editor/document-and-scenes.md#scenes.
